### Traer todas las aulas
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms

### ---

### Crear aula
POST http://localhost:3000/classrooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laboratorio",
  "duenio": "Pepe"
}

### ---

### Obtener aula por codigo (join_code)
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/code/GL-1180

### ---

### Obtener aula por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/classrooms/13

### ---

### Eliminar aula por ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/classrooms/154
